waiver emmc-line-5 rtl/eMMC_top.sv:415,416,419 line \
  reason="err_cmp raise arm: requires a read-data content corruption with a VALID CRC16; the card model can only inject CRC-level errors, and the DUT verifiably does not corrupt data (every clean round compares exact 256-bit blocks). Unreachable without a DUT bug."
